### E2E walkthrough through the gateway (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Prereqs: docker compose up -d, then seed auth + catalog (see README).

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 0. Aggregate health
GET {{gateway}}/health/services

### 1. Register a new user (also provisions a profile + welcome notification via events)
# @name register
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ngPass!"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ngPass!"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.refreshToken}}

### 3. Who am I
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Rotate the refresh token
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 5. My profile (created asynchronously from user.registered)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Update profile + preferences
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Jane Doe",
  "bio": "Microfrontend enthusiast"
}

### 6b. Merge preferences (per-microfrontend UI settings)
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/v1/profiles/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "theme": "dark",
  "catalog.pageSize": 24
}

### 7. Browse the catalog: search + filter + sort + paginate
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/products?search=keyboard&minPriceCents=1000&sort=priceCents&order=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 7b. Categories
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/categories

### 8. Create an order (Idempotency-Key required; prices come from the catalog)
# @name createOrder
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0001

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008", "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "line1": "42 Federation Way",
    "city": "Kolkata",
    "postalCode": "700001",
    "country": "IN"
  }
}

@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.data.order.id}}

### 8b. Replay the same request — same order back, x-idempotent-replay: true
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-0001

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 9. My orders
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Admin: login and mark the order paid (drives order.status_changed event)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

###
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PAID"
}

### 11. Notifications produced by the events (welcome, order confirmed, order paid)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/notifications?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11b. Mark all read
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. Frontend analytics ingestion (batched, works anonymously too)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    { "type": "page.view", "payload": { "remote": "catalog", "path": "/products" } },
    { "type": "product.click", "payload": { "productId": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001" } }
  ]
}

### 13. Admin: analytics summary (frontend events + all domain events)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Admin: create a product
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ergonomic Mouse",
  "slug": "ergonomic-mouse",
  "description": "Vertical wireless mouse",
  "priceCents": 6499,
  "stock": 80,
  "categoryId": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
}

### 15. Logout (revokes the refresh token)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
